OL,3,GNEWSAOffshore workers turn to
OL,4,Aweight-loss jabs to meet helicopter
OL,5,Aweight rules
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of offshore workers have been
OL,8,Fusing weight-loss jabs to help meet
OL,9,Fmaximum weight rules for helicopter
OL,10,Fflights due to come into force next
OL,11,Fweek.
OL,13,FFrom Sunday, anyone weighing more than
OL,14,F19st 7Ib (124kg) in civilian clothing
OL,15,Fand footwear will be banned from taking
OL,16,Fa flight to an offshore platform
OL,17,Fcovered by UK safety regulations.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
PN,42902
