CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F429A1793350560
OL,1,W5j 5Qwsj#%7k"k#j  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOffshore workers turn to
OL,4,Aweight-loss jabs to meet helicopter
OL,5,Aweight rules
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen the new rules were announced last
OL,8,Fyear, about 2,200 workers were over the
OL,9,Flimit but that figure has now fallen to
OL,10,Ffewer than 250, according to Offshore
OL,11,FEnergies UK (OEUK).
OL,13,FThe industry body told BBC Scotland
OL,14,FNews that on one platform, 60% of staff
OL,15,Fhad been taking weight-loss drugs and
OL,16,Fextra fridge space had been provided to
OL,17,Fkeep the medications cool.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
